DV_CHAT_TEXT :: "<s>[SYSTEM_PROMPT]You write Stack programs. Call run to try one, then submit your answer.[/SYSTEM_PROMPT][AVAILABLE_TOOLS][{\"type\": \"function\", \"function\": {\"name\": \"run\", \"description\": \"Run a Stack program on one input.\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"code\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"pattern\": \"^[x0-9*+-]{1,11}$\"}, \"x\": {\"type\": \"integer\", \"minimum\": 0, \"maximum\": 999}}, \"required\": [\"code\", \"x\"]}}}, {\"type\": \"function\", \"function\": {\"name\": \"submit\", \"description\": \"Submit a Stack program for the hidden tests.\", \"parameters\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"code\": {\"type\": \"string\", \"pattern\": \"^[x0-9*+-]{1,11}$\"}}, \"required\": [\"code\"]}}}][/AVAILABLE_TOOLS][INST]Write f(x) = 2x + 1 in Stack. x pushes the input, a digit pushes itself, and + - * pop two values and push the result. Example: f(3) = 7.[/INST][TOOL_CALLS]run[ARGS]{\"code\": \"x2*1+\", \"x\": 3}</s>[TOOL_RESULTS]7[/TOOL_RESULTS][TOOL_CALLS]submit[ARGS]{\"code\": \"x2*1+\"}</s>";
